    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dual Souls Dualist&quot; is a deckbuilding roguelike where you fight by combining two decks. Players team up as a pair of characters and take on an evil corporation that's plotting to take over the city. As you ascend through the corporation's skyscraper, the enemies become stronger. Power up your cards and skills to prepare for these challenging encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Deck Combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Choose two characters to form a duo and combine their decks for battle. Discover synergistic effects between the characters' cards and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Card Cost System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000In this game, the cards in your hand are your resources. For example, to play a 1-cost card, you must discard one card from your hand when playing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge-Based Attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Charge cards to your characters to enable them to use their skills. Efficiently charge your cards and deliver devastating blows to your enemies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dual Souls Dualist&quot; is a deckbuilding roguelike where you fight by combining two decks. Players team up as a pair of characters and take on an evil corporation that's plotting to take over the city. As you ascend through the corporation's skyscraper, the enemies become stronger. Power up your cards and skills to prepare for these challenging encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Deck Combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Choose two characters to form a duo and combine their decks for battle. Discover synergistic effects between the characters' cards and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Card Cost System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000In this game, the cards in your hand are your resources. For example, to play a 1-cost card, you must discard one card from your hand when playing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge-Based Attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Charge cards to your characters to enable them to use their skills. Efficiently charge your cards and deliver devastating blows to your enemies.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Dual Souls Dualist&quot; is a deckbuilding roguelike game where you combine two decks to create endless strategies. Charge up the cards you draw, unleash powerful attacks, and conquer the evil corporation's skyscraper stronghold while defeating enemies along the way.\uff0e",
